/* == 20. the owner's mouse and keyboard (D290, owner 2026-10-13) =========
   Every mouse or keyboard shown as a DEVICE is his own picture
   (brand/devices/mouse-*.webp, keyboard-*.webp): HOME's pills and the
   devices sheet (devbar.js devicePic), the set's `mouse` / `keycap` names
   (pic(): Device's Connection line, the Aim doors and cards), the Aim and
   Mappings choosers and the wizard. They are black with a silver rim, so
   in the dark theme their outer black edge would sink into the card: a thin
